Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.90,0:00:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.70,0:02:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同學們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,課本上的點與點連好了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.40,0:02:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像這樣由三條直線圍成的叫三角形
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.80,0:02:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而由四條直線圍成的則是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柴田同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.10,0:02:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣了 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和平時一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家的眼神都很悲傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.30,0:02:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愛 你又在煩惱了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.30,0:03:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}死衚衕的對面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是地獄少女那裏看到的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.20,0:03:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概 是下一個下地獄的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.60,0:03:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼她要告訴你這些事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.80,0:03:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個人在公園的哪裏上吊的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.60,0:03:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雲梯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雲梯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.10,0:03:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.00,0:04:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 雲梯 雲梯啊 是雲梯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 啊 這個這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,松野邊鎮員工神祕自殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.20,0:04:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是這個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是那裏的鎮長嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.30,0:04:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個人也在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一看就像是做了壞事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自殺了的桐野家族成員怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.50,0:04:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一個上高中的女兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.30,0:04:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妻子十多年前就死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.10,0:04:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家裏的事情好像都是女兒在幹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.30,0:04:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鎮長在工作上名聲相當不錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.50,0:04:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他那當助手的兒子有許多不好的傳言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向日葵苑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,現在的話 現在的話還可以原諒你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去自首吧 把真相說出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少可以保住性命
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,適可而止吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.80,0:05:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲你爸爸死得那麼慘才特別照顧你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.80,0:05:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞清楚自己的立場啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閃開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我借的錢就...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請 請等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.50,0:06:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.90,0:06:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.60,0:06:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.60,0:06:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它忘掉 明白嗎 我出去一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 這麼晚了你去哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請您確認遺體
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.60,0:06:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從解剖結果來看 應該是自殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信封呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.30,0:06:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大約這麼大的 應該帶着的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.90,0:06:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 什麼也沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請節哀順便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.50,0:07:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.00,0:07:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您沒有必要出席追悼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.10,0:07:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我不能出席呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,問問自己的良心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太沒禮貌了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.00,0:07:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,義行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來你對我有些誤解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別裝傻了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.60,0:07:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒裝傻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.90,0:07:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看見照片了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是誤解 交給警方調查吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天請您回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 太沒禮貌了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鎮長爲職員的死感到悲傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從繁忙的公務中抽出空來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.20,0:07:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到這裏出席追悼會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然叫他回去 真是太…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給我走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我確實看見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使你說看見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.20,0:08:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有證據我們沒辦法調查啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被他們銷燬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你適可而止吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.80,0:08:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,楠木鎮長怎麼可能做這種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要錢的話有很多更好的辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.50,0:08:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1}有其父必有其女 把自殺怪別人 是想要錢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7}向鎮長道歉    滾出鎮子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.10,0:09:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桐野小姐 打擾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.30,0:09:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請問是哪位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.10,0:09:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我是雜誌社的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我對媒體已經說了很多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誰也沒有認真對待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有人寫了完全相反的內容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.30,0:09:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鎮長級別的醜聞啊很難處理啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.60,0:09:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一個人死了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.30,0:09:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很多地方都登了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.70,0:09:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是被殺的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.70,0:09:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有證據就沒有說服力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.40,0:09:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這一點你應該也明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.70,0:09:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜訪你之前我向當地人打聽了不少事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幾乎沒有人說楠木的壞話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.10,0:10:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常熱心 致力於福利事業
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對此處的敬老院也有高額捐款
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.40,0:10:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我看見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,楠木 他兒子義行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和黑社會的人在一起的照片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是要將此事公開的爸爸死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照片也不知去向
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.20,0:10:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是會自殺的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼想也覺得奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.50,0:10:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這就是全部經過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管別人怎麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只相信自己看到的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.40,0:10:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要緊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.70,0:10:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我習慣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您還是幫我寫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.00,0:10:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請報道楠木一事尚有懸疑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有確鑿證據的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.50,0:10:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.80,0:10:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個世界上是有規則的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保護殺人犯的規則嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種規則的話 沒有必要去遵守
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和地獄少女見過嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.50,0:11:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,見過嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.90,0:11:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.30,0:11:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放棄掉吧 報仇這事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.20,0:11:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總之希望你放棄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我纔不要聽你的教訓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.60,0:11:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給我些時間可以嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.90,0:11:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會試着調查
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然不知道你能不能滿意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.90,0:11:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會試着得出結論
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看了那個再做決定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底有什麼目的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.70,0:11:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不覺得報了仇只會感到空虛嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請允許我單刀直入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.60,0:12:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桐野先生的死因不是自殺吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.30,0:12:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白您爲什麼會這樣問
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲桐野先生的女兒這樣告訴我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這可就爲難了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然相信這種毫無根據的謊言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也沒有證據證明它是謊言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.60,0:12:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您想怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是想知道真相
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是怎樣的真相
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想找到能讓自己信服的答案
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就不用再談下去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請讓我見鎮長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.10,0:12:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想和他談談
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請回吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吧 能聽見吧楠木先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.50,0:12:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你 區區自由撰稿人好大的口氣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.10,0:12:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才能當自由撰稿人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.80,0:12:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,義行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.90,0:13:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我雙親早亡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是祖母撫養我長大的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.70,0:13:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我還沒好好報答她就去世了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.40,0:13:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以一看到老人總是心懷愧疚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過我自己也是老人了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真晚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉抱歉 工作堆了好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谷本太太 您的腰好些了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.70,0:13:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能不要緊 我已經不行啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.30,0:13:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您這樣子 精神還是不錯的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.90,0:13:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上任院長死去後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.60,0:13:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裏的土地和建築物所有權證書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都落到黑社會的人手裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.30,0:13:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他們計劃在這裏建設高級公寓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是那樣的話老人們就無家可歸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我懇求他們終止計劃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.80,0:13:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而在其他方面給黑社會行方便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,僅此而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.70,0:14:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桐野察覺了這一點向我們勒索
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們不可能向這種卑鄙的人妥協
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.30,0:14:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,當然拒絕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能他欠債了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.50,0:14:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙明白了不可能拿到錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.30,0:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就自殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.70,0:14:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有責任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.00,0:14:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他說想供女兒上東京的大學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的男人怎麼會自殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您明白自己在說什麼嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒有下手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.00,0:14:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但肯定是有人爲了我而下的手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寫不寫由你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可如果我垮了這裏就完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.70,0:14:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是這裏倒閉了會怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住在這裏的老人們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天大概就這些了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.10,0:15:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果你爸爸的死因還是沒弄清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.80,0:15:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我會再去和楠木談談
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.00,0:15:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 世上有些事情是無法分清楚善惡的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.30,0:15:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得這個事件也許就是這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.30,0:15:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 請放棄報仇吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定會後悔的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.00,0:16:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然僱用那種筆桿流氓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.60,0:16:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然不知道你在想什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.00,0:16:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過就這樣兩清了如何
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鎮長變得很沮喪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.80,0:16:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請不要再令他苦惱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:12.60,0:16:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虧你能說出這麼傲慢的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.90,0:16:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傲慢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.10,0:16:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傲慢的是你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.70,0:16:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是爸爸垮臺了你知道會怎樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:22.30,0:16:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人會遇到困難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.10,0:16:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你爸爸死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.80,0:16:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你一個人流淚而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.70,0:16:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只爲自己的感情就要毀了這個鎮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也該醒悟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.50,0:16:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鎮裏的人對你生氣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,絕不是不講理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.50,0:16:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不會寫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.90,0:16:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這件事我會藏在心底
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有一事相求
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.50,0:16:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請你向桐野先生的女兒低頭認錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向她磕頭認錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也快上大學了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.90,0:17:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼上班 結婚 都是一眨眼的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必須更加努力工作纔行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.50,0:17:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別這麼說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.00,0:17:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不給你準備一套嫁妝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.70,0:17:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是會讓你難堪的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 工作了 工作了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.20,0:17:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答應那女孩要得出結論
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能想到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.90,0:17:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就只有求您做這件事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已經只剩下你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸就只有你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.50,0:18:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能聽這種人說的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.40,0:18:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以後肯定會勒索錢財
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是桐野不對還是你不對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我敢說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桐野的女兒的心是純粹的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.30,0:18:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和你被玷污的兒子不同 是純粹的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.40,0:18:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.80,0:18:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我作爲一個父親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很羨慕擁有這樣的女兒的桐野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.30,0:18:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您也是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼無聊的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.70,0:18:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以桐野沙樹小姐的名義
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.40,0:18:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您父親開設了一個帳戶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.50,0:18:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原本放在鄙行的出租保險箱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:59.10,0:19:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由於合同期已滿 所以交給您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.50,0:19:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果您能夠繼續存下去的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼拼命地工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:15.00,0:19:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果只留下這麼點錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難怪想敲詐別人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果死得那麼慘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.10,0:19:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是說他倒黴 還是說他可憐呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我是柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我現在帶楠木去你那裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會讓他向你謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請等着我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.10,0:19:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已經無所謂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.60,0:20:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已經想清楚應該怎麼做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你決定放棄報仇了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸是無可代替的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.80,0:20:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他做了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對我來說都是個慈祥的爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.50,0:20:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而那幫人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.00,0:20:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.20,0:20:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個鎮子怎麼樣和我沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能爲爸爸做的就只有這個了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.10,0:20:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.80,0:20:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:02.50,0:21:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.70,0:21:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 爸爸他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.40,0:21:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.70,0:21:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送你前往地獄的小船上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.20,0:21:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.20,0:21:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 是那個孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個孩子把我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.70,0:21:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能讓我向那個孩子道個歉嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我無能爲力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.10,0:21:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:42.60,0:21:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直認爲無論自己何時死去都不會有遺恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.10,0:21:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來還是留下了一件事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.80,0:21:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.90,0:22:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,楠木亮造 松野邊鎮鎮長失蹤事件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至今已經過了一週
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行蹤仍未明瞭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:20.70,0:22:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲他是做了壞事的人嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:25.10,0:22:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣不好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.80,0:22:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別說太好了這種話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.70,0:22:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.50,0:22:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(800,0)}向日葵苑已於十月十三日起關閉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.50,0:23:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.10,0:23:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.60,0:23:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.50,0:23:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.60,0:23:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.40,0:23:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.40,0:24:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.40,0:24:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.70,0:24:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.60,0:24:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,湊 三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.40,0:24:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要離開自己出生的故鄉嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.90,0:24:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要在這個島上度過一生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要妨礙我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.20,0:24:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼那個人不惜要這樣做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.90,0:24:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.00,0:24:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將那個人流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.50,0:24:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&\an7}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}島上的女人
